@page "/aqaaid"
@using global::Quran.Data

<PageTitle>Aqaaid</PageTitle>

<div class="container py-4">
    <div class="row mb-4">
        <div class="col-12 text-center">
            <h2 class="display-6 fw-bold">Aqaaid</h2>
            <p class="lead mb-0">A clear overview of the foundations of faith in Arabic, Zulu, and English.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row g-4">
        <div class="col-lg-6">
            <div class="card shadow-sm h-100">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h3 class="card-title fw-bold mb-3">The 5 Pillars of Islam</h3>
                    <ol class="list-group list-group-numbered">
                        <li class="list-group-item">
                            <div class="fw-semibold">Iman (إِيمَان)</div>
                            <div class="small text-muted">Zulu: Ukholo | English: Faith</div>
                            <p class="mb-0 mt-2">Belief in Allah, His angels, books, messengers, the Last Day, and divine decree.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li class="list-group-item">
                            <div class="fw-semibold">Salah (صَلَاة)</div>
                            <div class="small text-muted">Zulu: Ukuthandaza | English: Prayer</div>
                            <p class="mb-0 mt-2">The prescribed prayers performed five times each day to maintain closeness to Allah.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li class="list-group-item">
                            <div class="fw-semibold">Sawm (صَوْم)</div>
                            <div class="small text-muted">Zulu: Ukuzila | English: Fasting</div>
                            <p class="mb-0 mt-2">Fasting during the month of Ramadan as a means of self-discipline and taqwa.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li class="list-group-item">
                            <div class="fw-semibold">Zakah (زَكَاة)</div>
                            <div class="small text-muted">Zulu: Ukunikela | English: Charity</div>
                            <p class="mb-0 mt-2">Giving a portion of wealth to help the poor and strengthen the community.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li class="list-group-item">
                            <div class="fw-semibold">Hajj (حَجّ)</div>
                            <div class="small text-muted">Zulu: Ukhunjiswele | English: Pilgrimage</div>
                            <p class="mb-0 mt-2">The pilgrimage to Makkah, which every able Muslim is required to perform at least once in life.</p>
                        </li>
                    </ol>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-lg-6">
            <div class="card shadow-sm h-100">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h3 class="card-title fw-bold mb-3">The 7 Pillars of Belief</h3>
                    <ol class="list-group list-group-numbered">
                        <li class="list-group-item">
                            <div class="fw-semibold">Allah (اللَّه)</div>
                            <div class="small text-muted">Zulu: uNkulunkulu | English: God</div>
                            <p class="mb-0 mt-2">Belief in the One True God, the Creator and Sustainer of all things.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li class="list-group-item">
                            <div class="fw-semibold">Angels (الْمَلَائِكَة)</div>
                            <div class="small text-muted">Zulu: Izingelosi | English: Angels</div>
                            <p class="mb-0 mt-2">Belief in angels as Allah’s obedient servants who carry out His commands.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li class="list-group-item">
                            <div class="fw-semibold">Books (الْكُتُب)</div>
                            <div class="small text-muted">Zulu: Izincwadi | English: Scriptures</div>
                            <p class="mb-0 mt-2">Belief in the revealed books, including the Quran, Torah, Gospel, and Zabur.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li class="list-group-item">
                            <div class="fw-semibold">Messengers (الرُّسُل)</div>
                            <div class="small text-muted">Zulu: Abathunywa | English: Prophets</div>
                            <p class="mb-0 mt-2">Belief in the prophets and messengers sent by Allah to guide humanity.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li class="list-group-item">
                            <div class="fw-semibold">Qiyamah (الْقِيَامَة)</div>
                            <div class="small text-muted">Zulu: Usuku lokwahlulela | English: The Day of Judgment</div>
                            <p class="mb-0 mt-2">Belief in the resurrection and the final Day of accountability.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li class="list-group-item">
                            <div class="fw-semibold">Taqdeer (الْقَدَر)</div>
                            <div class="small text-muted">Zulu: Ukunquma kukaNkulunkulu | English: Divine Decree</div>
                            <p class="mb-0 mt-2">Belief that everything happens by the will and knowledge of Allah.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li class="list-group-item">
                            <div class="fw-semibold">Akhirah (الْآخِرَة)</div>
                            <div class="small text-muted">Zulu: Impilo eyalandelayo | English: The Hereafter</div>
                            <p class="mb-0 mt-2">Belief in life after death, reward, punishment, paradise, and hellfire.</p>
                        </li>
                    </ol>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

